<BaseLayout locale="en" title="About"><section class="head"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">UNMTD1 / ABOUT</div><h1 class="display">Women shaping music, one story at a time.</h1></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container article"><p class="lead">UNMTD1 est une plateforme éditoriale bilingue qui met en lumière les femmes qui créent, produisent, enregistrent, organisent et font vivre la musique.</p><h2>The idea</h2><p>A mini-series brings together three women around a theme, a role, a scene or a shared question. One story is published each week, with YouTube video and audio whenever available.</p><h2>An open project</h2><p>The site is designed as an editorial MVP hosted on GitHub Pages. Content is separated from code so new stories can be added in Markdown.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
